{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14106190","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14106190","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1410619001:0":{"text":"因度厄，你在这里盯了好久，我说你该不会是想——","source_cn":"因度厄，你在这里盯了好久，我说你该不会是想——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79C7DB199B1E624F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410619002:0":{"text":"喂！停停停！你还真往嘴里放啊！不怕和我一样再也长不大了？！","source_cn":"喂！停停停！你还真往嘴里放啊！不怕和我一样再也长不大了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7852FB1D39F3DE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410619003:1":{"text":"味道完全一样……\n<style=\"highlight\">龙的蛋清就是恩典灵露。</style>","source_cn":"味道完全一样……\\n<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD90134763C9ED160","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410619004:0":{"text":"根本没有什么恩典……我们不过是在榨取着另外一群生灵的性命……","source_cn":"根本没有什么恩典……我们不过是在榨取着另外一群生灵的性命……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA20EB5735B6561EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410619005:0":{"text":"女王欺骗了我们，而斐利尔……死于这个肮脏的秘密。","source_cn":"女王欺骗了我们，而斐利尔……死于这个肮脏的秘密。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C586BBAF093F647","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410619006:1":{"text":"节哀。至少那小子没看错朋友。","source_cn":"节哀。至少那小子没看错朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E39B1BE7C13C924","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410619007:0":{"text":"你现在怎么打算？复仇？还是回去认个错，继续守卫你们伟大的萨洛克兰？","source_cn":"你现在怎么打算？复仇？还是回去认个错，继续守卫你们伟大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84F46E8873194375","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410619008:1":{"text":"我心里有无数个问题需要答案，找到答案之前，我不会回去。","source_cn":"我心里有无数个问题需要答案，找到答案之前，我不会回去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DF85D6EEE5A6147","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410619009:0":{"text":"为什么龙会任由自己的后代被如此剥削？","source_cn":"为什么龙会任由自己的后代被如此剥削？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC70618F48FDAEC01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410619010:0":{"text":"为什么我们会遭受孽化，只能靠剥削他者的生命来苟活？","source_cn":"为什么我们会遭受孽化，只能靠剥削他者的生命来苟活？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B08D8480F366313","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410619011:0":{"text":"还有，为什么这里会有如此多的龙蛋？是有人运过来吗？","source_cn":"还有，为什么这里会有如此多的龙蛋？是有人运过来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DA256BBE42FDE6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410619012:0":{"text":"还是……龙就在这里？在这附近？","source_cn":"还是……龙就在这里？在这附近？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE21DD5C3AB1DA776","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410619013:0":{"text":"啧……这、这我可说不清楚。","source_cn":"啧……这、这我可说不清楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4249E14FC1008D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410619014:0":{"text":"为什么要避开我的眼神，心虚？","source_cn":"为什么要避开我的眼神，心虚？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x047990FF3CC2825A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410619015:0":{"text":"啊？我只是转了转眼珠！总不能只有心虚的时候才能转眼珠子吧。","source_cn":"啊？我只是转了转眼珠！总不能只有心虚的时候才能转眼珠子吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B61C57BDF95E2B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410619016:0":{"text":"对，还要加上撒谎的时候。","source_cn":"对，还要加上撒谎的时候。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCF6C7E4489C4AFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410619017:0":{"text":"我、我没有撒谎！","source_cn":"我、我没有撒谎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFABD37A5AFCBEAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410619018:0":{"text":"但你的叙述不流畅，可能是脑子里在想该如何编造合理的谎言。","source_cn":"但你的叙述不流畅，可能是脑子里在想该如何编造合理的谎言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9480A746F6F0C6A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1410619018":{"text":"但你的叙述不流畅，可能是脑子里在想该如何编造合理的谎言。","source_cn":"但你的叙述不流畅，可能是脑子里在想该如何编造合理的谎言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9480A746F6F0C6A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410619019:0":{"text":"我们相处了这么久，你还是怀疑我？我这颗千锤百炼犹如钢铁的心脏都狠狠疼了几下！","source_cn":"我们相处了这么久，你还是怀疑我？我这颗千锤百炼犹如钢铁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5516BD0103C3AF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1410619021:0":{"text":"我只是……只是觉得，这么多证据叠加，就算这里真有一只龙，也不奇怪吧？","source_cn":"我只是……只是觉得，这么多证据叠加，就算这里真有一只龙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BE58B70D1CAFFCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410619022:0":{"text":"我们去审一审旁边的矮人，他知道的应该更多。","source_cn":"我们去审一审旁边的矮人，他知道的应该更多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5730BD664B7DAD71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:0:1":{"text":"我也认为祖娅很可疑","source_cn":"我也认为祖娅很可疑","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF658C5726A0897F2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"我也认为祖娅很可疑","female":"我也认为祖娅很可疑","variant_male_record_index":"72028","variant_female_record_index":"72029","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410619020:0":{"text":"经历了这些事，多一些怀疑才是理智的表现。","source_cn":"经历了这些事，多一些怀疑才是理智的表现。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E5E0793EED7D37D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:1:2":{"text":"因度厄，你不要逼她","source_cn":"因度厄，你不要逼她","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x083AD606598E2584","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"因度厄，你不要逼她","female":"因度厄，你不要逼她","variant_male_record_index":"72030","variant_female_record_index":"72031","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"祖娅","source":"祖娅","status":"source"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"因度厄","source":"因度厄","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":26,"localized_text_count":25,"speaker_count":2}}